OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine and dry
OL,6,Fat first, with any early evening
OL,7,Fsunshine becoming increasingly hazy.
OL,8,FCloud will steadily thicken from the
OL,9,Fwest, bringing outbreaks of light rain
OL,10,Fovernight. Becoming breezy, especially
OL,11,Falong the coast, with the rain turning
OL,12,Fincreasingly patchy.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FRain, light and patchy,
OL,15,Fslowly clearing east during the
OL,16,Fmorning. Then mostly dry with sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the afternoon, although
OL,18,Fwinds will freshen. The odd shower
OL,19,Fprobable in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
