OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and isolated mainly coastal
OL,7,Fshowers Wednesday, wind easing. Mostly
OL,8,Fdry Thursday, with hazy sunshine.
OL,9,FEarly rain and breeze Friday clearing
OL,10,Flater. Temperatures around average for
OL,11,Fearly September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
